{
  "title": "Ziyarate Imam Ali Raza (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الصِّدِیْقُ الشَّهِیْدُ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alssiddiqu alshshahidu\nPeace be upon you, O the truthful, the martyr,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْوَصِیُّ الْبَآرُّ التَّقِیُّ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alwasiyyu albarru alttaqiyyu\npeace be upon you, O the successor, the dutiful, the pious,\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلوٰۃَ\nashhadu annaka qad aqamta alssalata\nI bear witness that you established the prayer,\nوَاَتَیْتَ الزَّكوٰۃَ\nwa atayta alzzakata\nand paid the poor-rate,\nوَاَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ\nwa amarta bilma`rufi\nand enjoined what is right,\nوَنَهَیْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ\nwa nahayta `ani almunkari\nand forbade what is wrong,\nوَعَبَدْتَ اللّٰهَ حَتیّٰ اَتَاكَ الْیَقِیْنُ\nwa `abadta allaha hatta ataka alyaqinu\nand worshipped Allah until certainty (death) came to you.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya aba alhasani\nPeace be upon you, O Abu al-Hasan,\nوَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلیٰ عَلِیِّ ابْنِ مُوْسَی الرِّضَا الْمُرْتَضیٰ\nallahumma salli `ala `aliyyi bni musa alrrida almurtada\nO Allah, send blessings upon `Ali the son of Musa al-Rida, the well-pleasing,\nعَبْدِكَ وَوَلِیِّ دِیْنِكَ الْقَائِمِ بِعَدْلِكَ\n`abdika wa waliyyi dinika alqa'imi bi`adlika\nYour servant and the guardian of Your religion, the upholder of Your justice,\nوَالدَّاعِیْ اِلیٰ دِیْنِكَ وَدِیْنِ اٰبَائِهِ الصَّادِقِیْنَ\nwalddda`i ila dinika wa dini aba'ihi alssadiqina\nand the caller to Your religion and the religion of his truthful forefathers,\nصَلوٰۃً لاَ یَقْویٰ عَلٰی اِحْصَائِهَا غَیْرُكَ\nsalatan la yaqwa `ala ihsa'iha ghayruka\nwith blessings that none but You can number.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلیٰ عَلِیِّ ابْنِ مُوْسَی الرِّضَا الْمُرْتَضَی\nallahumma salli `ala `aliyyi bni musa alrrida almurtada\nO Allah, send blessings upon `Ali the son of Musa al-Rida, the well-pleasing,\nالْاِمَامِ التَّقِیِّ النَّقِیِّ\nal-imami alttaqiyyi alnnaqiyyi\nthe Imam, the pious, the pure,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ عَلیٰ مَنْ فَوْقَ الْاَرْضِ وَمَنْ تَحْتَ الثَّریٰ\nwa hujjatika `ala man fawqa al-ardi wa man tahta alththara\nand Your Argument over whoever is above the earth and whoever is beneath the soil,\nاَلصِّدِّیْقِ الشَّهِیْدِ\nalssiddiqi alshshahidi\nthe truthful, the martyr,\nصَلَوَاۃً كَثِیْرَۃً نَامِیَۃً زَاكِیَۃً مُتَوَاصِلَۃً مُتَوَاتِرَۃً مُتَوَافِرَۃً\nsalawatan kathiratan namiyatan zakiyatan mutawasilatan mutawatiratan mutawafiratan\nwith abundant, ever-growing, pure, continuous, uninterrupted, plentiful blessings,\nكَاَفْضَلِ مَا صَلَّیْتَ عَلیٰ اَحَدٍ مِنْ اَوْلِیَائِكَ۔\nka'afdali ma sallayta `ala ahadin min awliya'ika\nthe best of what You have sent upon any of Your intimate friends."
}
